OL,3,GNEWSAMan arrested after pedestrians
OL,4,Astruck by car
OL,5,
OL,6,FA driver has been arrested after a man
OL,7,Fand a woman were seriously injured when
OL,8,Fthey were hit by a car in
OL,9,FLeicestershire.
OL,11,FThe two pedestrians were struck by a
OL,12,Fred Peugeot 3008 in Loughborough Road,
OL,13,Fnear to the junction with Granite Way,
OL,14,Fin Quorn at about 15:30 BST on Tuesday.
OL,16,FLeicestershire Police said the driver
OL,17,Fof the Peugeot was not injured.
OL,19,FA 67-year-old man was arrested on
OL,20,Fsuspicion of causing serious injury by
OL,21,Fdangerous driving and released under
OL,22,Finvestigation.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
